<h2>Order Confirmation</h2>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>Thank you for your order! We've received your order #{{orderNumber}} and it's being processed.</p>
<h3>Order Details:</h3>
<ul>
{{#each items}}
    <li>{{this.name}} - Quantity: {{this.quantity}} - Price: {{this.price}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<p><strong>Total: {{total}}</strong></p>
<a href="{{orderUrl}}" class="button">View Order</a>
<p>We'll send you another email when your order has been shipped.</p>
<p>Best regards,<br>The Matsak Team</p>
